# ── Corpus data (reproducible; not source) ──────────────────────────────────
# Every judgment can be re-fetched from its `source_url`, and the candidate
# ledger records what was examined and why it was kept or rejected. Committing
# the artefacts would add ~750 MB of binaries that git cannot diff.
#   rebuild:  python -m backend.ingestion.fetch_judgments --target 1500
#             ./scripts/index-judgments.sh
data/raw/judgments/pdf/
data/raw/judgments/*.parquet
data/raw/statutes/
data/processed/judgments_sc/judgments.json
data/processed/judgments_sc/candidate_ledger.json
data/processed/judgments_sc/_backup_260/
data/processed/judgments_sc/_baseline/
data/processed/judgments/
data/processed/chunks/
data/processed/statutes/

